                "text": "<p>Sapphire Shadow Studio was born from one woman's leap of faith, backed by her husband's unwavering belief that she could pull it off.</p><p>For nearly a decade, Maddie worked in emergency departments as an EMT and nurse. The work was meaningful, but the hours were relentless. The schedule dictated everything. Time with family and friends became something squeezed into gaps rather than built around. Creativity? That lived somewhere in the margins, waiting.</p><p>Then came the late nights with a different kind of purpose. Sketching designs instead of charting vitals. Testing fabrics instead of taking temperatures. What started as a search for better work-life balance evolved into something bigger: a creative outlet that finally felt like hers.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "narrow",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "pretty",
                "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                "background": false,
                "background_color": "#00000026",
                "corner_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 0,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
